# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ship a Homebrew zip (maintainer)
#
# First publish (after the Homebrew cask lands on main):
#   git push origin main
#   git tag v2.0.0
#   git push origin v2.0.0
#
# That tag must match package.json "version". GitHub Actions "Release"
# builds Q-Calc-<version>.zip, attaches it to the GitHub release, and
# writes the sha256 into Casks/q-calc.rb.
#
# Later versions:
#   1. Bump "version" in package.json (e.g. 2.0.1)
#   2. Commit that bump (and any app changes)
#   3. git tag v2.0.1
#   4. git push origin main v2.0.1
#
# Or run workflow Release from the Actions tab (uses package.json version).
# Field Macs get the cask on brew update; autoupdate upgrades q-calc daily.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
